# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) for local development. Both are git-ignored.
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables reach the app — they are inlined into the JS bundle, so never put secrets here.
# Declare every variable in src/lib/env.ts. For EAS cloud builds/updates use `npx eas-cli@latest env:create`.

# Base URL of the app's backend API (optional until the app has one).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
